WEBVTT

00:00:09.713 --> 00:00:10.713
You believe us now?

00:00:12.681 --> 00:00:14.321
Mm-hmm.

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:15.961
[siren wailing]

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.967
["You Know How We Do It"
playing]

00:00:18.076 --> 00:00:19.097
Hey, Bob!

00:00:19.206 --> 00:00:21.138
Hey, Maria,
how you doing?
Hey!

00:00:21.247 --> 00:00:22.559
Ah.

00:00:24.674 --> 00:00:26.133
Working on my moves.

00:00:26.242 --> 00:00:28.383
Just keepin' it green.
No need to burn the fuel.

00:00:28.683 --> 00:00:29.683
Speaking of fuel--
[groans]

00:00:36.433 --> 00:00:37.433
Closed? [sighs]

00:00:38.773 --> 00:00:39.913
That doesn't seem right.

00:00:45.196 --> 00:00:48.360
[electronic beeping]

00:00:53.533 --> 00:00:54.533
Close.

00:00:58.713 --> 00:00:59.713
Yes.

00:01:00.433 --> 00:01:02.853
Makeover, makeover.
Look at you.

00:01:02.853 --> 00:01:03.853
Freeze! Police!

00:01:05.173 --> 00:01:06.633
Oh, my God,
you got robot hands.

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:08.833
No, they're gloves.

00:01:08.953 --> 00:01:10.833
Get 'em up.
Now spread your fingers!

00:01:12.252 --> 00:01:14.752
Now wiggle 'em!
Wiggle your digits!

00:01:16.233 --> 00:01:19.252
Yes! Like you just finished
a big musical number.

00:01:20.773 --> 00:01:21.773
Good.

00:01:22.313 --> 00:01:23.713
Why is there
a light on your head?

00:01:27.513 --> 00:01:29.653
'Cause I'm the sheriff
for the weekend, pal.

00:01:38.063 --> 00:01:39.463
[Sonic] Ugh. Water.

00:01:40.103 --> 00:01:41.683
Why did it have to be water?

00:01:43.769 --> 00:01:45.030
[exhales]

00:01:45.162 --> 00:01:47.062
Okay, you can do this.

00:01:50.763 --> 00:01:52.403
Gotta go fast.

00:02:12.431 --> 00:02:15.566
[grunting]

00:02:16.507 --> 00:02:18.144
[Sonic yells]

00:02:19.015 --> 00:02:21.522
[yelling]

00:02:28.106 --> 00:02:30.683
[panting]

00:02:30.788 --> 00:02:33.923
[straining]

00:02:49.493 --> 00:02:51.200
[coughing]

00:03:01.789 --> 00:03:04.088
[gasps]

00:03:22.862 --> 00:03:24.326
Oh!

00:03:27.391 --> 00:03:28.855
[grunts]

00:03:35.612 --> 00:03:38.872
I don't want
to die like this!
It's derivative!

00:03:40.452 --> 00:03:41.992
Make room for Daddy!

00:03:43.708 --> 00:03:45.212
[grunting]

00:03:49.606 --> 00:03:51.467
Two and two.
Great!

00:03:51.873 --> 00:03:54.373
We're still bipedals,
more or less.
[sighs]

00:03:58.283 --> 00:03:59.283
Fire in the hole!

00:04:01.423 --> 00:04:04.863
I've solved it.
There is a booby trap
every seven seco--

00:04:10.963 --> 00:04:13.723
That was a little early.
Mmm.

00:04:13.723 --> 00:04:17.903
Oh! So glad it didn't
cut off my mustache.

00:04:18.263 --> 00:04:20.322
Hey,
Little Red Wrecking Ball.

00:04:20.862 --> 00:04:23.442
I know you're dying
to get your Emerald on,

00:04:23.783 --> 00:04:26.903
but can we be
a little bit more mindful
of our surroundings?

00:04:27.583 --> 00:04:28.583
May I?

00:04:28.689 --> 00:04:30.220
[glove beeping]

00:04:35.313 --> 00:04:37.653
[electronic voice]
In 30 feet, turn left.

00:04:38.153 --> 00:04:39.993
Work smarter, not harder.

00:04:54.345 --> 00:04:57.420
[Sonic yelling]

00:04:58.446 --> 00:05:01.008
[grunting, groans]

00:05:01.112 --> 00:05:02.452
My pelvis.

00:05:07.423 --> 00:05:11.442
Okay, Secret Temple,
let's see what you've got.

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.397
Whoa!

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.139
No, no, no! No!

00:05:21.651 --> 00:05:23.221
[yells]

00:05:23.324 --> 00:05:25.543
[exclaiming]

00:05:25.645 --> 00:05:26.772
No.

00:05:27.763 --> 00:05:28.763
Yes! [screams]

00:05:35.213 --> 00:05:36.933
[electronic voice]
You have arrived
at your destination.

00:05:37.233 --> 00:05:39.673
Wow. That really
opened up the space.

00:05:40.233 --> 00:05:42.433
I can't even picture it
with an impenetrable wall now.

00:05:43.233 --> 00:05:44.833
And the rubble
is always a nice touch.

